name extsizes
category Package
revision 17263
shortdesc Extend the standard classes' size options
relocated 1
longdesc Provides classes extarticle, extreport, extletter, extbook and
longdesc extproc which provide for documents with a base font size from
longdesc 8-20pt. There is also a LaTeX package, extsizes.sty, which can
longdesc be used with nonstandard document classes. But it cannot be
longdesc guaranteed to work with any given class.
runfiles size=35
